flowchart TD
    %% Actors
    U[Users] -->|HTTPS| API
    A[Administrators] -->|HTTPS| API

    subgraph Application [FastAPI Web Application]
        API["FastAPI App<br>main.py"]
        Auth[JWT Auth<br>auth.py]

        subgraph Routers [API Routers]
            AuthR[auth_router<br>/api/auth]
            UsersR[users<br>/api/users]
            QuizR[quizzes<br>/api/quiz]
            EventsR[events<br>/api/events]
            LearningsR[learnings<br>/api/learnings]
            AIToolsR[ai_tools<br>/api/ai-tools]
            AdminR[admin<br>/api/admin]
        end

        subgraph SSR [Server-Side Rendering]
            Jinja[Jinja2 Templates + HTMX]
            UserPages[User Pages · Dashboard · Skillgames · Learning · Events · AI Tools]
            AdminPages[Admin Panel · Overview · Users · Learnings · Events · AI Tools]
            Jinja --> UserPages
            Jinja --> AdminPages
        end

        API --> Routers
        Auth -.->|JWT dependency| Routers
        Routers -->|inject data| Jinja
    end

    subgraph DataLayer [Data Layer]
        DB[(SQL Database)]

    end

    Routers -->|SQLAlchemy ORM| DB
    Seeders[Database Seeders<br>database_seeders/<br>Run on startup] -->|seed initial data| DB
    API -.->|triggers on startup| Seeders

    %% Static Assets
    Static[Static Files<br>/static/css/] -.->|served| U
